# S635 routing-strategy untouched-save hydration

date: 2026-11-04
HEAD: 9e75fc44

## Reproduction
- Packaged host at http://127.0.0.1:3480/router/strategy rendered Routing mode=baseline, Scoring strategy=balanced, Execution scope=remote_only, Measured-latency override=off.
- Untouched Save (through a logging proxy on :3490 forwarding to the packaged :3480 host) captured:
  {"execution_mode":"remote_only","routing":{"mode":"baseline","pin_weights":false,"scoring_strategy":"balanced"}}
  Host accepted: data-router-posture-status=saved, "Routing posture saved."
- Mounted tests also capture the exact PUT body; both baseline and a non-default hybrid/cost/decision_only posture are covered.

## Root-cause repair
- ReadbackLoaded("routerConfig") now hydrates model.routerPosture from routing.mode/strategy, routing.scoringStrategy, executionMode, pinWeights, and routing.weights, falling back to the host defaults baseline/balanced/decision_only when rows are absent. Existing non-empty drafts are preserved.
- Save still has a defensive readback/default fallback, so an untouched save cannot post null even if the readback arrives late.

